    "detailed_description": "Dreams of Valhalla is an action rogue where you battle through the 9 realms in order to obtain eternally glory in Valhalla.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player controls a single hero and fights off a hordes of enemies (100s). <br />\r\nThe player becomes stronger by defeating enemies and obtaining experience to &quot;level up&quot;.<br />\r\nUpon leveling up, the player may choose between a variety of abilities to help them against even more difficult enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach realm has a unique set of enemies and a unique boss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe goal is to defeat the boss of each realm and be blessed as Einherjar. Thus obtaining the  priviledge to enter Valhalla.",
